                                            "The itinerary of a race."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "57205918-2334-4251-a090-486e461712a8",
                                                "sense_id": "4dafb913-2378-3e3d-a3de-a26967ed5486",
                                                "text": "The cross-country course passes the canal."
